          "reason": "Import existing keyboard/mouse owning declarations, ignore name-field break codes so releasing the tenth letter cannot cancel entry, terminate names within their original11-byte storage, and initialize the same original game frame for maximum-length names. Initialize both WIN result records and stop both name renderers at the existing NUL terminator.",
          "verification": "Actual original menu unit fails undeclared get_char/mouse_int_handler. Original ten-character entry fails UBSan index11; corrected terminator alone exposes missing game frame, then full make/break sequence reproduces tenth-letter release cancelling GET_NAME. Corrected owning field tests pass allthese cases. Actual browser landscapeANA/portrait10-character names both reach originalWIN through screenshot-only picture identification and ordinary on-screen typing, then Escape returns. Actual Android WIN showed ANA followed by stray X/U. Two additional owning regressions independently fail on the prior source: printMachine stores patterned uninitialized name/guess tails, and both renderers draw five glyphs from ANA\\0XU rather than three. Zero-initialized WIN records and bounded NUL-aware render loops pass both tests."
        },
        {
          "file": "proj/code/read_write.c",
          "originalSha256": "face99661c94c8ff39b2595321e9f26858f4a3c6f406d94e7872407a713a83f4",
          "patchedSha256": "b95ac09af2333fb0f447d4f97b60b6689a24ba97ed85231c7325e3070e3ca206",
          "reason": "Write one newline after each stored winner name and read bounded, terminated names while consuming the complete line, preserving the original record format.",
          "verification": "Original real five-record write/read roundtrip fails first newly won ANA delimiter. Corrected exact file prefix and allfive date/time/score/name records pass, including10-character names and pre-existing newline-terminated names. With only writer correction supplied, the original reader independently fails patterned-storage name termination before strcmp; corrected reader consumes allfive record boundaries and terminates each name."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
